{"ref":"BDB, אוּר","hw":"אוּר","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוּר</span></big>  <strong>n.m. flame</strong>. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְכוּ בְאוּר אֶשְׁכֶם</span> <em>walk in the flame of your fire</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.11\">Is 50:11</a>, & so fire itself, whose light & flame were seen <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.16\">44:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 47:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.47.14\">47:14</a>—exile Is. + <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 31:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.31.9\">31:9</a> & <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.2\">Ez 5:2</a> (Co <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁ</span>).","next":"BDB, אֻרִים","prev":"BDB, אוֹרָה²"}